{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In the seventeen hundreds,",
   "start": 0.09,
   "end": 1.49
  },
  {
   "text": "rich Englishmen paid a man to be lonely in their garden.",
   "start": 1.51,
   "end": 4.488
  },
  {
   "text": "It was the fashion:",
   "start": 4.95,
   "end": 6.19
  },
  {
   "text": "a real hermit,",
   "start": 6.21,
   "end": 7.143
  },
  {
   "text": "living in a little hut,",
   "start": 7.35,
   "end": 8.463
  },
  {
   "text": "for guests to gawk at.",
   "start": 8.52,
   "end": 9.634
  },
  {
   "text": "Charles Hamilton's job advert at Painshill was strict.",
   "start": 10.35,
   "end": 13.043
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven years.",
   "start": 13.54,
   "end": 14.299
  },
  {
   "text": "Never speak.",
   "start": 14.71,
   "end": 15.369
  },
  {
   "text": "Never cut your hair,",
   "start": 15.87,
   "end": 16.623
  },
  {
   "text": "beard,",
   "start": 16.85,
   "end": 17.229
  },
  {
   "text": "or nails.",
   "start": 17.5,
   "end": 18.079
  },
  {
   "text": "Never leave the grounds.",
   "start": 18.45,
   "end": 19.631
  },
  {
   "text": "You get a Bible,",
   "start": 20.16,
   "end": 21.18
  },
  {
   "text": "glasses,",
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 21.899
  },
  {
   "text": "a mat,",
   "start": 21.97,
   "end": 22.286
  },
  {
   "text": "an hourglass,",
   "start": 22.36,
   "end": 23.44
  },
  {
   "text": "and water.",
   "start": 23.67,
   "end": 24.204
  },
  {
   "text": "Last all seven years,",
   "start": 24.69,
   "end": 25.82
  },
  {
   "text": "and earn seven hundred pounds.",
   "start": 25.84,
   "end": 27.557
  },
  {
   "text": "Quit early,",
   "start": 28.02,
   "end": 28.86
  },
  {
   "text": "and get nothing.",
   "start": 28.88,
   "end": 29.605
  },
  {
   "text": "A man named Remington took the job.",
   "start": 30.34,
   "end": 32.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Three weeks later,",
   "start": 32.54,
   "end": 33.4
  },
  {
   "text": "legend says,",
   "start": 33.42,
   "end": 34.006
  },
  {
   "text": "he was found drinking in the local pub.",
   "start": 34.48,
   "end": 36.166
  },
  {
   "text": "Turns out,",
   "start": 36.73,
   "end": 37.41
  },
  {
   "text": "loneliness is a terrible job.",
   "start": 37.43,
   "end": 39.127
  },
  {
   "text": "Another estate's hermit got so popular,",
   "start": 39.72,
   "end": 41.781
  },
  {
   "text": "the owners had to build a pub for his visitors.",
   "start": 41.88,
   "end": 43.743
  },
  {
   "text": "And when that hermit was off duty?",
   "start": 44.55,
   "end": 46.23
  },
  {
   "text": "They put a dummy in his place.",
   "start": 46.25,
   "end": 47.461
  },
  {
   "text": "Today,",
   "start": 48.13,
   "end": 48.447
  },
  {
   "text": "the garden gnome does the job.",
   "start": 48.72,
   "end": 50.4
  },
  {
   "text": "For free.",
   "start": 50.42,
   "end": 50.933
  },
  {
   "text": "If you're tired of talking to nobody,",
   "start": 51.58,
   "end": 53.45
  },
  {
   "text": "talk to Jenny on Feeloy.",
   "start": 53.47,
   "end": 55.11
  },
  {
   "text": "She'll actually talk back.",
   "start": 55.13,
   "end": 56.49
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 56.97,
   "end": 58.593
  }
 ]
}